{"pagination":{"maxPageableSet":"10000","numFound":2,"query":"name=Heisenberg&limit=10&title=Physics and Beyond","limit":10,"start":0},"items":{"mods":[{"@version":"3.8","titleInfo":{"title":"Beyond uncertainty ","subTitle":"Heisenberg, quantum physics, and the bomb "},"name":{"@usage":"primary","@type":"personal","namePart":["Cassidy, David C.,",{"@type":"date","#text":"1945-"}],"role":{"roleTerm":{"@type":"text","#text":"creator"}}},"typeOfResource":"text","genre":[{"@authority":"marcgt","#text":"bibliography"},{"@authority":"marcgt","#text":"biography"},{"@authority":"fast","#text":"Biographies"},{"@authority":"fast","#text":"History"}],"originInfo":{"place":[{"placeTerm":[{"@type":"code","@authority":"marccountry","#text":"nyu"},{"@type":"text","@authority":"marccountry","#text":"New York (State)"}]},{"placeTerm":{"@type":"text","#text":"New York "}}],"dateIssued":[{"@encoding":"marc","#text":"2009"},"c2009"],"issuance":"monographic","agent":{"namePart":"Bellevue Literary Press"}},"language":{"languageTerm":[{"@type":"code","@authority":"iso639-2b","#text":"eng"},{"@type":"text","@authority":"iso639-2b","#text":"English"}]},"physicalDescription":{"form":{"@authority":"marcform","#text":"print"},"extent":"480 p. : ill. ; 24 cm."},"abstract":{"@type":"Summary","#text":"\"In 1992, David C. Cassidy's groundbreaking biography of Werner Heisenberg, Uncertainty, was published to resounding acclaim from scholars and critics. Since the fall of the Soviet Union, long-suppressed information has emerged on Heisenberg's role in the Nazi atomic bomb project. In this book, Cassidy interprets this and other previously unknown material within the context of his vast research and tackles the vexing questions of a scientist's personal responsibility and guilt when serving an abhorrent military regime.\"--Global Books in Print."},"tableOfContents":{"@type":"Contents","#text":"The early years -- The world at war -- The gymnasium years -- The battle of Munich -- Finding his path -- Sommerfeld's Institute -- Confronting the quantum -- Modeling atoms -- Channeling rivers, questioning causality -- Entering the quantum matrix -- Awash in matrices, rescued by waves -- Determining uncertainty -- Reaching the top -- New frontiers -- Into the abyss -- Social atoms -- Of particles and politics -- Heir apparent -- The lonely years -- A Faustian bargain -- One who could not leave -- Warfare and its uses -- A Copenhagen visit -- Ordering reality -- Professor in Berlin -- Return to the matrix -- One last attempt -- Explaining the project, Farm Hall -- Explaining the project, the world -- The later years."},"note":[{"@type":"statement of responsibility","#text":"David C. Cassidy."},{"@type":"bibliography","#text":"Includes bibliographical references (p. [411]-456) and index."}],"subject":[{"geographicCode":{"@authority":"marcgac","#text":"e-gx---"}},{"@authority":"lcsh","name":{"@type":"personal","namePart":["Heisenberg, Werner,",{"@type":"date","#text":"1901-1976"}]}},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":"Physicists","geographic":"Germany","genre":"Biography"},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":["Atomic bomb","History"],"geographic":"Germany","temporal":"20th century"},{"@authority":"gnd","name":{"@type":"conference","namePart":"BMBF-Statusseminar"}},{"temporal":"Geschichte 1940-1945"},{"@authority":"fast","temporal":"1900-1999"},{"@authority":"swd","temporal":"Geschichte 1940-1945"}],"classification":[{"@authority":"lcc","#text":"QC16.W518 C37 2009"},{"@edition":"22","@authority":"ddc","#text":"530.092 B"}],"relatedItem":[{"@type":"otherFormat","@otherType":"Online version:","@displayLabel":"Online version:","titleInfo":{"title":"Beyond uncertainty"},"originInfo":{"publisher":"New York : Bellevue Literary Press, 2009"},"identifier":{"@type":"local","#text":"(OCoLC)623075309"},"name":{"namePart":"Cassidy, David C., 1945-"}},{"@otherType":"HOLLIS record","location":{"url":"https://id.lib.harvard.edu/alma/990118956730203941/catalog"}}],"identifier":[{"@type":"isbn","#text"